  "title": "Orla Shareholders Overwhelmingly Approve Business Combination with Equinox Gold",
  "summary": "Vancouver, BC, July 22, 2026 – Orla Mining Ltd. (TSX: OLA; NYSE: ORLA) (“Orla” or the “Company”) is pleased to announce that holders of Orla common shares (the “Shareholders”) have overwhelmingly approved the previously announced business combination (the “Arrangement”) with Equinox Gold Corp. (TSX: EQX, NYSE American: EQX) (“Equinox Gold”) pursuant to a court-approved plan of arrangement, whereby Equinox Gold will, among other things, acquire all of […]",
